* Task 8 fixture: combined minimal end-to-end integration test
* Demonstrates all SQL extraction features working together in one source:
*   - Native SQL SELECT statement (Task 2 / FR-19)
*   - Native SQL host-var references with bare (#) form (Task 4 / FR-21)
*   - PROCESS SQL flexible block (Task 7 / FR-19, FR-21)
*   - Opaque-body host-var references with colon-mandatory form (Task 7 / FR-21)
*   - Feature-06 CALLNAT edge (unchanged, regression check)
* Expected composite result from Analyze:
*   - DataAccess: EdgeReads for SQL-PERSONNEL (SELECT FROM) + EMPLOYEE-DATA (PROCESS SQL DDM)
*   - HostVarRefs: #NAME, #SALARY, #PERS-ID (from SELECT), then :#NAME (from opaque body)
*   - Edges: CALLNAT 'NDBERR' (feature-06, unchanged)
*   - All entries in global source order

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #NAME (A30)
  1 #SALARY (N9.2)
  1 #PERS-ID (N5)
END-DEFINE

SELECT EMP_NAME, EMP_SALARY INTO #NAME, #SALARY
  FROM SQL-PERSONNEL
  WHERE PERS_ID = :#PERS-ID
  CALLNAT 'PROCESS'
END-SELECT

PROCESS SQL EMPLOYEE-DATA
  << SELECT EMP_ID FROM SALARY_TABLE
     WHERE PERS_ID = :#NAME >>

CALLNAT 'NDBERR'

END
